//!   [`fn_801e5460`], [`fn_801e60b0`], [`fn_801e65f0`], [`fn_801e6a30`]).
//! - `0x801E6BE0`-`0x801E8DD0` - HID report dispatch and the report decoders
//!   for the core remote, nunchuk, classic controller and balance board
//!   ([`fn_801e6be0`], [`fn_801e7050`], [`fn_801e74c0`], [`fn_801e7be0`],
