//!   ([`fn_801f9d10`], [`fn_801f9d30`], [`fn_801f9d50`], [`fn_801f9d70`],
//!   [`fn_801f9d90`], [`fn_801f9db0`], [`fn_801f9dd0`]) and the application-id
//!   dispatch ([`fn_801f6a00`]).
//! - `0x801E5450`-`0x801EFFA0` - fourteenth pass (wave 97): the KPAD channel
//!   block layer that owns the four `0x578`-byte records, the pointer-aim
//!   filters above it and the IOS/GKI shims underneath. The block group is the
