/// Zeroes both 32-entry queue arrays (`0x803CDBA8`, `0x803CDC28`) and the nine
/// pool records, sets the exclusion mask `0x803CDD98 = 0xFFF0`, creates five
/// pools, and finally publishes the size-ordered id table
/// `0,1,2,3,4` at `0x803CDD9A` with count `5` at `0x803CDDA3`.
///
/// # Safety
/// The five arenas (`0x803A531C`, `0x803A615C`, `0x803A6F94`, `0x803AE5B4`,
/// `0x803BBA0C`) are fixed image addresses and must be writable.
///
