/// Allocates a buffer of at least `size` bytes from the first pool that fits.
///
/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_801f6fb0` at `0x801F6FB0` (416 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/main-gb/export/801f6fb0_FUN_801f6fb0.c`
/// - Already called by address as [`BTA_HH_GETBUF`] from the HID-host layer.
///
/// # Arguments
/// * `size` - requested payload size in bytes; `0` is rejected.
