/// The payload pointer (`block + 8`), or `0` when the size is zero, larger
/// than every pool, or every fitting pool is exhausted.
///
/// # Side effects
/// Logs `0xFFF6`/`0xFFF7` on the two size errors. On success it pops the head
/// of the chosen free list under [`fn_801f8760`], bumps the used/high-water
/// counters, and marks the header `state = 1` with the current task as owner.
