//   the method table at `r13-0x4B00` and arms the alarm object `0x803D1620`;
// * the `0x1700`..`0x170E` API request builders `0x801FF5A0`..`0x801FF91C`
//   (same allocate/fill/post shape as the wave-50 DM builders) and the event
//   demultiplexer `0x801FFCC4` with its name table `0x801FFE10`.
//
// The HID-host "method table" is an indirect-call structure: slots `+0`,
// `+4`, `+8` and `+0xC` are called with literal argument lists by
// `0x801F9B50`..`0x801F9BE0`. Its address lives in `r13-0x4B00`.

