/// - Ghidra: `FUN_801fac44` at `0x801FAC44` (176 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/main-gb/export/801fac44_FUN_801fac44.c`
///
/// # Arguments
/// None.
///
/// # Returns
/// `()`.
///
/// # Side effects
/// One state clear, three zero-argument calls, one 3-argument relay pair, the
/// HID teardown, and one timer arm.
