/// Adds or removes one discovery-slot record and reports it.
///
/// For a record whose `+0x0A` state byte is non-zero the address is inserted
/// into the discovery table (when it is new), the slot's `+6`/`+7` bytes are
/// set to `1`/`0` and event `5` is reported. Otherwise the matching slot is
/// removed by shifting the following slots down; the removal then clears the
/// "search done" byte and, when a completion was deferred, stops the defer
/// timer and runs [fn_801fbce0]. A pending DM disable is completed by arming
/// the `0x803D1888` timer when the BTM layer reports no outstanding work.
/// Every path ends with event `6` and the current pending-state byte.
///
/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_801fc5e4` at `0x801FC5E4` (640 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/main-gb/export/801fc5e4_FUN_801fc5e4.c`
/// - String: `"timer stopped"` at `0x80347668`.
///
/// # Arguments
/// * `report` - `0x105` event record: state byte at `+0x0A`, `BD_ADDR` at
///   `+0x0B`.
///
