/// - Ghidra: `FUN_801fcd7c` at `0x801FCD7C` (132 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/main-gb/export/801fcd7c_FUN_801fcd7c.c`
///
/// # Arguments
/// * `event` - event record; the 16-bit mode is read at `+6`.
///
/// # Returns
/// `()`.
///
/// # Side effects
/// One byte store, two calls on the `r2-0x4C70` state record and two on
/// `0x80213058`.
///
/// # Safety
/// `event` must be readable at `+8`; the `r2` state record must be live.
