// `0x801FD4BC`, `0x801FD83C`), the HID-host event pump (`0x801F9FA0`), the
// state machine at `0x801FF970` and the three WUD save/device steps
// (`0x801F0B10`, `0x801F1F70`, `0x801F2650`).

/// `0x803CDDF0`: first of four one-byte HID-host mode fields. `2` while the
/// transport is up.
